    "text": "By Brent Taylor ,\n21 hours ago Football is back on today, so make your coffee and kick on the TV! Indiana nearly blew it last night as an appetizer, and now we have a whole day of ball ahead of us. Alabama kicks off against South Carolina later this evening in the 6:00 time slot, so you have plenty of time to go about your day… or just watch more ball. Read full article",
